      "task_statement": "Apply the complete mamba-ssm 2.3.2.post1 selective state update to finite contiguous float32 tensors with shape B=8,H=4,D=32,N=8,G=2, supplied D, z and dt_bias, torch-threshold softplus, no state remapping, and return y plus the complete state post-state.",
      "input_map": [
